    "id": "6e49b6807886e1d42b22245dd394a2f19a99bfb5",
    "message": "wp433 P2a: credentials.json cua gws (W4, W5) tren POSIX nam ngoai kho git, khong xuyen lien ket, ghi nguyen tu\n\nDac ta GWS-CRED-DICH-NGOAI-KHO-A r1 (sha256 b0065947f941...), lease wp433-r2-g1-claude, Issue #433.\n\n- M1 `_duong_dich_chuan(p, cwd)`: ghep cwd theo chuoi, bo thanh phan rong va `.`, tu choi NUL / chi khoang\n  trang / `..` / goc `/`; ly do `duong khong hop le: <repr>`.\n- M2 `_dich_cred_gws(cfgdir_tho)`: POSIX goi `_kiem_dich_ghi(dest, \"/\", <moi thanh phan>)` nen luat (b) lstat\n  moi to tien tu `/` toi chinh tep; nen khac giu dich nhu cu. W4/W5 ghi bang `_ghi_nguyen_tu_0600`, chot dich\n  va writer trong mot `try ... except OSError`. W4 kiem kieu/encode truoc; `gws_cred` co mat ma sai kieu\n  (ke ca falsy) bi tu choi thay vi coi la thieu.\n- M3: W4 in dung mot dong `[bootstrap] ✗ <cum>: <chi tiet>` + degraded; W5 tra `(False, \"<cum>: ...\")`.\n- M4: fragment wp433_gws_cred_dich_ngoai_kho — 11 ca / 46 luot, 37 dot bien, 3 tu kiem phan hang, so luot.\n- M5: tai sinh scripts/tl_test_fragments_bundled.py bang generate_bundled_module_bytes.\n\nKhong sua than `_kiem_dich_ghi`, `_trong_kho_git`, `_ghi_nguyen_tu_0600`. Windows: chi doi sang ghi nguyen tu.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrZVGCtqQDy1hD7e1sR",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-19T07:38:49Z",
    "tree_id": "6d49d42d31e6b415f9c5472258365bab828ee605"
   },
